      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK NZ (7) was far from disgraced when resuming with a fifth in the Australasian Trotting Championship. Showed ability last campaign including a win at this circuit and distance and a Group 1 placing in the Great Square in Brisbane. Draws wide but owns a strong second-up record so should be improved. KYVALLEY MAVEN (6) made a nice return at his latest appearance a week ago, racing parked from this barrier but sticking on well and finishing 2.6 metres away in second at this circuit and distance. Has recorded a win and two placing from three second-up attempts so improvement is likely. TIMMY TURTLE NZ (1) drew on the back row last time but had recorded a win and a close second in his previous two attempts here. Up in grade but he is better served by the ace draw. MORE WANTED (5) has been tackling Group races of late so may find this more to his liking.",
